Before answering Project Sekai questions, use the SekaiSync MCP tools.

1. Check `sekaisync_freshness`.
2. Resolve proper nouns with `sekaisync_resolve_name`.
3. Look up facts with `sekaisync_lookup`.
4. Use `sekaisync_fact_pack` for generation context.
5. Verify drafts with `sekaisync_verify_claims`.

Never translate official localized names from memory. Never assume the JP schedule applies to Global, TW/HK/MAC, KR, or CN. If the local store has no match, say the fact is outside SekaiSync coverage.
